{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026R7NprXKO5V1794733191.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天文台預料本周會有冷鋒橫過，周五市區氣溫最新降至最低16度。</p><p></p><p>本港日間大致天晴，大部分地區，最低氣溫都有20度。</p><p></p><p>天文台表示，受一股清勁偏東氣流影響，未來一兩日廣東沿岸地區雲量較多，有一兩陣雨，早晚較為潮濕。預料一道冷鋒將於周三橫過華南沿岸，該區北風增強及有幾陣雨，氣溫顯著下降。受隨後的東北季候風及一道雲雨帶影響，本周後期廣東沿岸早晚普遍清涼。</p><p></p><p>本港周三起氣溫顯著下降，跌至周四最低18度，周五周六市區最低氣溫只有16度。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.251026+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T01:03:14.444984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:34.895571+00:00","content_hash":"49db45e4c06497a39b9b96e3c2db43a7f5c3580bd52e5c0033db34435fc15f96","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.251026+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}